{
  "bookId": "hero-212002",
  "id": "bond-27501",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27501001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你在吃药，生病了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，有点感冒，医生说是病毒感染。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "病病病病病毒？！感感感感感染？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不至于那么惊讶吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "为、为什么......偏偏是你呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好痛！你咬我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "说不定，玲的抗体可以救你！\n但是队长说，即使直接注射抗体，幸存率也很低......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "怎么办，怎么办......你是玲最重要、最想守护的人。\n别怕，就算是最坏的结果，我也会一直陪你——到最后一刻。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我想你误会了。这个世界没有Cerebrum，也没有丧尸。\n普通的流感病毒只会让人鼻塞头疼几天哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "哎——哎哎哎？\n那，那刚才的算什么啊，意意意味不明的肉麻时刻！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没关系，我可以当作没听见。\n痛！你又咬？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27501012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "忘掉忘掉！现在立刻忘掉！！！啊呜——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
